Package: printer-driver-fp620kp
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, cups, cups-filters, ghostscript
Recommends: system-config-printer
Description: CUPS driver for the Jolimark FP-620K+ 24-pin printer
 This package provides a CUPS filter, backend and PPD for the Jolimark
 FP-620K+ 24-pin dot matrix printer.  The filter generates ESC/P2K
 graphics directly, supports 180x180, 360x180 and 360x360 dpi modes,
 and defaults to unidirectional printing so vertical lines stay straight.
 .
 The backend reads the USB printer status through LPGETSTATUS and
 reports paper-out and offline conditions to CUPS.  A small helper,
 fp620kp-setup, creates the print queue after the driver is installed.
